  "note": "Route families for apps/web vinext Worker builds. Ownership uses the OpenNext family rules (cloudflare/opennext/prune.ts). api-ops owns the OpenNext global deny list; every other family excludes it. nodeOnly lists entries that still need Node-only APIs and so have no Worker home yet. A `rest` family owns every entry no other enabled family owns, except nodeOnly entries.",
